@memef1f1y/dsh-plugin-proxy README · Architecture：DSH and pi-ai issue requests through `globalThis.fetch`, which reads undici's
well-known global dispatcher slot (`Symbol.for('undici.globalDispatcher.1')`).
The plugin owns that slot:

@memef1f1y/dsh-plugin-proxy README · Edge cases handled：Child processes already running when you flip the switch keep the env they
were spawned with; undici's SOCKS5 agent is currently marked experimental
upstream.

@memef1f1y/dsh-plugin-proxy README · Known limits：- Windows registry, Linux-desktop proxies and PAC are not followed in
  `system` mode (env vars work everywhere).
- `*` in `noProxy` bypasses everything by design — use with care.
